# Slot 2 Target C-II research shard salvage provenance (2026-10-05)

This is a fresh-main recovery of unique, unreviewed research artifacts from the 90-ref SHA-256 8-f review shard. It does not change `docs/state/theorem-state.yaml`, promote a theorem, or close Target C-II. Imported reports stay discovery material. Finite scripts certify only their local checks and do not establish global optimality.

